llvm-dsdl (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build and statically link LLVM/MLIR at the revision pinned in
    packaging/toolchain/llvm.pin instead of a distribution's, so the compiler
    emits the same code wherever it is installed.
  * dsdlc: add --generate-support to select support code independently of the
    code derived from definitions.
  * dsdlc: add the + selector for types carried in the embedded UAVCAN catalog.
  * Add the showroom example and its build-system integration recipes.
  * Restructure the documentation and publish the manual as a site.
  * Add CodeQL analysis, Dependabot, and a security disclosure policy.

 -- OpenCyphal Maintainers <maintainers@opencyphal.org>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 05:00:01 +0000

